---
source: crates/splot-cli/tests/help_snapshots.rs
expression: "help(\"explain\")"
---
Describe a validator diagnostic rule id (or list them all)

Usage: splot explain [OPTIONS] [RULE_ID]

Arguments:
  [RULE_ID]  The diagnostic rule id to describe (e.g. `obu-header/global-xlayer-required`). Omit it with `--list` to enumerate every rule id instead

Options:
      --list        List every known rule id instead of describing one
  -v, --verbose...  Increase logging verbosity (repeatable: -v, -vv, -vvv)
      --json        Emit the output as JSON
      --quiet       Silence all logging except errors
  -h, --help        Print help
  -V, --version     Print version
